The web driver can be given a face's metrics without its bytes: the kernel measures with
them and the page paints with a CSS font-family it already owns (CADCraft's system UI
stack). A family registered this way never loads the bundled fallback face.
Upstreamable as is; see apps/ui/docs/slab-foundation.md.

